# Daily Plan — required settings
#
# TEMPLATE ONLY. Never put real values in this file; it is committed.
# Copy to `.env` (which .gitignore excludes) if local tooling ever needs them.
#
# Today nothing runs locally, so none of these live on a developer machine.
# This file exists to record WHAT is required and WHERE each one is set,
# so the project can be picked up without guesswork.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Set in the Supabase dashboard, under Edge Functions -> Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Used by the `coach` function to call the Anthropic API.
# This one costs real money when used. Budget is enforced in `coach_config`.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Provided automatically by Supabase to every edge function
#    Listed for completeness — you do not set these yourself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# SUPABASE_URL
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY               safe in a browser; publishable by design
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY       ADMIN. Must never reach a browser or this repo.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Stored as rows in the `app_secret` database table, not as env vars
#    That table has row level security on and no policy, so only the
#    service role can read it. Edge functions read it at request time.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# cron_secret     shared secret the pg_cron job sends to `notify`;
#                 without a match the function returns 403
# vapid_subject   contact URL or mailto for Web Push
# vapid_public    Web Push public key
# vapid_private   Web Push private key — treat as a real secret

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Not a secret, but required to know
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

